# INVWIN3.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: an item's service
# records.  Record > Service records shows item 1's records.  INS shows a new record, its
# item preset, refused while its type, then its summary, is missing and
# while its cost is negative, each time the message under the fields and
# the focus on the field; mended and dated, it is added, and the list
# fetched again holds it in date order.  The new record edited and saved
# keeps the selection on its row, and shows the change in view mode; ESC
# goes back to the item list.  In the location order (Next order), item 3 has no
# records, and ESC goes back to that order, item 3 selected; Items > Service lists both
# records, the newest added first; the end by Exit.  The new record's date
# is typed, so that no snapshot holds the day of the run.
# TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWIN3.SNP is its snapshot.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER
K ALT-C S
S RECORDS
K INS
S NEW
K ENTER
S NOTYPE
# DOWN picks the first type, TAB goes on to the summary
K DOWN TAB ENTER
S NOSUM
T Cleaned the drive heads
K TAB
T -5
K ENTER
S NEGCOST
# the cost mended, then back to the date
T 12.50
K STAB STAB STAB
T 2026-10-05
K ENTER
S ADDED
# done by: the fifth field
K DOWN CTRL-E TAB TAB TAB TAB
T N. Nelson
K ENTER
S SAVED
K ENTER
S SHOWN
K ENTER ESC
S ITEMS
K ALT-C R DOWN ALT-C S
S ITEM3
K ESC
S BYLOC
K ALT-I E
S RECENT
K ALT-F X
